NVMFG Unlock40 – distribution scope

The existing release notice states:
"The compiled application package may be shared with its documentation and
license notices. Third-party components retain their respective licenses.
No project source code is included in this release."

That permission is preserved in LICENSES/ORIGINAL-NOTICES.txt. It is a permission
for the compiled package, not an inferred open-source license for original
application code. Authorship of the adaptations: 禅堂 Zendo (RevoluSound Team), 2026.

The MIT terms for RTX40MFG-Unlock, the Profile Inspector wrapper and eligible
Streamline headers remain in LICENSES. MinHook/HDE retain their BSD terms.
Microsoft runtimes, Inno Setup and NVIDIA NGX SDK material have separate terms.

NVIDIA SDK terms are not replaced by the MIT license of another component.
The full NVIDIA RTX SDK license is in LICENSES/NVIDIA-RTX-SDK.txt.
The unresolved technical-limitation restriction is recorded in
../docs/provenance.md. Presence of these notices does not certify compatibility
of all uses with NVIDIA's terms.

Français : la permission existante autorise le partage du paquet compilé avec
ses documents et notices. Elle ne publie pas les sources et ne transforme pas
les composants NVIDIA en composants MIT. Les conditions de chaque tiers
restent applicables ; la réserve signalée dans la provenance n'est pas résolue.
